OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	The Deep Catacombs
Description	Spread through the old catacombs and take them for your own. The deeper you dig the more the dead object, and a rival keeper works the far side. Skirmish, 1 opponent plus heroes. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in a ruin, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

